    "summary": "Spend 1 CP right after an enemy unit picks its targets in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase). Pick 1 **THOUSAND SONS** unit of yours that is the target of at least one of the enemy unit's attacks.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, whenever a model in that unit is destroyed before it has fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 if the unit is wholly inside the [Flow of Magic](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.hexwarp-thrallband.flow-of-magic) of your army. With a result of 4+:\n\n- Leave the model in place.\n- Once the attacker has made all its attacks, the model can fight, then it is removed.",
